en games with their friends, and keep each play session short. Once players join a game room, they are given a mission to complete that lasts between 10 to 15 minutes. The game starts with a brief tutorial, that leads directly into the main story arch. The classes include Assassin, Devotress, Dungeon Archer, Illusionist, Pangolan, and Pit Fighter.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/warrior-epic"}